    {
      "number": 730,
      "sourceRefs": ["p0233#6"],
      "notation": "The powers immediately following (-7), (-4), and (-6) are part of the logarithm's argument. Explicit semantic grouping is log_3[(-7)^2], log_2[(-4)^3], log_6[(-6)^(-2)], not powers of undefined logarithms. The leading minus in part f is outside log_8(16).",
