        {"label": "c", "steps": "Argument 0 is not positive. 12^x never equals 0.", "answer": "undefined over R"},
        {"label": "d", "steps": "Argument (-4)^3=-64<0. 2^x never equals -64.", "answer": "undefined over R"},
        {"label": "e", "steps": "Argument (-6)^(-2)=1/(-6)^2=1/36>0; 6^(-2)=1/36.", "answer": "meaningful; value -2"},
        {"label": "f", "steps": "Argument 16>0; 8^x=16 becomes 2^(3x)=2^4, so x=4/3. Apply the external minus after computing the logarithm.", "answer": "meaningful; value -4/3"}
